    "Name": "Justicar",
    "Details": "The Justicar SecurityMech arms a machine gun and SRM 2 in the right arm for crowd control, backed by a small laser near the left wrist for close lethal threats. An LRM 5 in the left arm covers ranged engagements against vehicles or fighters. Six tons of heavy industrial armor offer modest protection.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Ubiquitous</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.71</color></b>",
